# U13 — PROJECT ISOLATION / USAGE / COST

Enforce approved-project isolation for:
- execution;
- usage;
- CI;
- git state;
- Observer projections.

Never borrow another project's state.

Cost identity:
`provider/model/channel/currency/input_rate/output_rate/effective_at/source/quality`.

Project totals must not be copied into every execution.
Estimated/partial usage must not become exact.

---

# U14 — SESSION / EXECUTION / WORKER EFFECT TRUTH

`PROMPTED / RESUMED / CLOSED / CANCELLED / COMPLETED`
require native side effect + observable/readback evidence.

Capability ladder:
`DECLARED -> DETECTED -> AVAILABLE -> INVOKED -> VERIFIED`.

Command construction is not execution.

Handler return is not completion; require typed effect/artifact/receipt/verification before `COMPLETED_LOCAL`.

Persist retry/effect identity.

