# EXECUTION DISCIPLINE

At execution start:
1. resolve latest `origin/main`;
2. read top authority + machine index + this taskpack + open register;
3. classify changed scope;
4. do not reopen CLOSED branch convergence;
5. short-lived branch -> PR -> exact-SHA CI -> merge;
6. update open register after each accepted card;
7. do not create another authority/taskpack unless the user explicitly changes top-level direction.

Every card returns:
- source SHA/tree;
- changed paths;
- before/after;
- positive test;
- negative test;
- runtime readback;
- frontend impact when applicable;
- rollback handle;
- evidence level;
- remaining limitations.
